<title>USA: Central Newspapers expands board to nine.</title>
<headline>Central Newspapers expands board to nine.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Newspapers Inc said Friday it elected Richard Snell as a director, expanding its board to nine members.</p>
<p>Snell is chairman, president and chief executive officer of Pinnacle West Capital Corp.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
